sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HH as Household resident
    actor Staff as Authorized HQ/rescuer evacuation verifier
    participant App as Resident app
    participant UI as Staff scanner/entry interface - required gap
    participant API as Existing verification/check-in API
    participant DB as Household, evacuation and member status records
    HH->>App: Display or save household QR
    App-->>HH: Generated household identification payload
    Staff->>UI: Scan or enter payload at evacuation arrival
    Note over Staff,UI: Complete dedicated staff interface was not established by audit
    UI->>API: Submit verification with authorized account and center
    API->>DB: Validate household/center and record accepted arrival
    API-->>UI: Confirmation or validation failure
    Note over API,DB: Diagram shows required end-to-end scope, not completed staff UI
